    "### Quartiles and Percentiles\n",
    "\n",
    "**Quartiles** divide sorted data into four equal parts:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Q1** (25th percentile): 25% of data below this.\n",
    "- **Q2** (50th percentile): the median.\n",
    "- **Q3** (75th percentile): 75% of data below this.\n",
    "- **IQR** = Q3 - Q1: the middle 50% of data.\n",
    "\n",
    "The **five-number summary** is min, Q1, median, Q3, max — the basis of box plots. Box plots are one of the most powerful EDA tools: they show center, spread, skewness, and outliers in a single visualization."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "be311adb",
